/* Accept a bare key OR an ISO timestamp. Legacy state stored full ISO strings, and
   splitting one on "-" yields "20T12:00:00.000Z" as the day — NaN — which silently
   resolved to 1970 and made every day calculation nonsense. Never fail to epoch on
   data a real user might be carrying. */
